# promise: #596 #643
# The theme editor's slider on a two-colour space makes the window see-through, as Arc's does (#596, #643).
# The space was saved by the editor before the fix: two colours on Light, opaque, so the slider only took them
# toward white. Moving the slider saves it again as Arc's editor does, vibrant at the slider's intensity, and
# the window shows the blurred desktop under the sidebar (SpaceThemeVariants.picked).
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
